cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Origenality, please cite it as below."
title: "Origenality: a bibliographic map of Origen studies"
# Le résumé est écrit par site/build-c/tools/build_summary_figures.py depuis les
# fichiers de tags livrés : un fichier lu par une machine ne porte pas de chiffre
# tapé à la main. Les balises tiennent dans des commentaires YAML, que le schéma
# 1.2.0 ignore.
# <!-- FIGURES:classification -->
abstract: >-
  A federated, deduplicated and thematically classified bibliography of
  scholarship on Origen of Alexandria, published as a queryable map of the
  field. Ten open bibliographic sources, deduplicated into one record per work,
  of which 21 104 are classified against a controlled vocabulary of themes,
  works of Origen and approaches: 6 742 of them — 4 909 core and 1 833
  partial — form the citable dossier. The code is under the MIT licence; the data
  are not, and DATA_POLICY.md states the regime that covers them, source by
  source.
# <!-- /FIGURES:classification -->
type: dataset
